0},{"year":2020,"total":735000},{"year":2021,"total":655000},{"year":2022,"total":659000},{"year":2023,"total":658000},{"year":2024,"total":658000},{"year":2025,"total":657000}],"footnotes":[{"year":null,"population_type":"STA","text":"Figure from 2009 census. 1,640 persons were registered by the Ministry of Interior as stateless at the end of 2012.","view":"asylum"},{"year":null,"population_type":"STA","text":"Figure from the 2009 census.","view":"asylum"},{"year":2023,"population_type":"STA","text":"Start-year figures come from the 2009 census, reporting 3585 stateless persons. In 2023, UNHCR conducted an extensive identification exercise of stateless persons in Azerbaijan using both government and UNHCR registers. The exercise was able to account for 513 stateless person. The government of Azerbaijan confirmed that between 2008 and 2023, 2306 stateless persons aquired citizenship of Azerbaijan.","view":"asylum"},{"year":2024,"population_type":"STA","text":"In 2023, UNHCR conducted an extensive identification exercise of stateless persons in Azerbaijan using both government and UNHCR registers. The exercise was able to account for 513 stateless person, which was used as the start year figure. During 2024, 306 individuals at risk of statelessness were able to acquire citizenship. Additional persons of undetermined nationality were identified during the year, resulting in a total of 271 stateless persons in the country at end-year based on information from the State Migration Service, the Ministry of Internal Affairs and UNHCR.","view":"asylum"},{"year":2025,"population_type":"REF,ROC,ASY,IDP,IOC,STA,OOC,RET,RDP,HST,OIP,RST,NAT","text":"All figures are as of mid-2025.","view":"asylum"},{"year":2025,"population_type":"STA","text":"All figures are as of mid-2025.  Since 2023, the number of stateless persons in Azerbaijan is based on government (State Migration Service and the Ministry of Internal Affairs) and UNHCR registers.","view":"asylum"}],"sources":["unhcr_countries","unhcr_population","unhcr_demographics","unhcr_idmc","unhcr_solutions","unhcr_asylum_applications","unhcr_footnotes","wpp_population","natural_earth"]}
